<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="The Church of the Fifth Dimension — a sanctuary for curiosity, wonder, and good works.">
  <title>Church of the Fifth Dimension</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #f7f2e8;
      --muted: #b8b2c7;
      --violet: #a98cff;
      --gold: #f3cd7b;
      --night: #0c0816;
      --line: rgba(255,255,255,.14);
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--ink);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% -10%, #3a2465 0, transparent 38rem),
        radial-gradient(circle at 85% 35%, #142b50 0, transparent 26rem),
        var(--night);
      font: 16px/1.65 ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
    }

    body::before {
      content: "";
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      opacity: .45;
      background-image:
        radial-gradient(circle, #fff 0 1px, transparent 1.5px),
        radial-gradient(circle, #fff 0 1px, transparent 1.5px);
      background-position: 0 0, 37px 53px;
      background-size: 91px 91px, 137px 137px;
      mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, #000, transparent 75%);
    }

    a { color: inherit; }
    .wrap { width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 40px)); margin: auto; }

    header {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 26px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .mark {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: .06em;
      text-decoration: none;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .sigil {
      display: grid;
      width: 38px;
      aspect-ratio: 1;
      place-items: center;
      border: 1px solid var(--gold);
      border-radius: 50%;
      color: var(--gold);
      font: 20px Georgia, serif;
      box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(243,205,123,.24);
    }

    nav { display: flex; gap: 28px; }
    nav a {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .85rem;
      letter-spacing: .08em;
      text-decoration: none;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    nav a:hover, nav a:focus-visible { color: var(--ink); }

    .hero {
      position: relative;
      display: grid;
      min-height: 720px;
      place-items: center;
      padding: 110px 0 130px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      color: var(--gold);
      font-size: .78rem;
      letter-spacing: .28em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1, h2, blockquote {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      font-weight: 400;
    }

    h1 {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin-top: 24px;
      font-size: clamp(4rem, 10vw, 8.5rem);
      letter-spacing: -.065em;
      line-height: .83;
    }

    h1 em {
      display: block;
      color: transparent;
      font-style: italic;
      -webkit-text-stroke: 1px var(--violet);
      text-shadow: 0 0 42px rgba(169,140,255,.2);
    }

    .intro {
      max-width: 620px;
      margin: 36px auto 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.15rem;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 32px;
      padding: 13px 22px;
      border: 1px solid var(--gold);
      border-radius: 99px;
      color: var(--night);
      background: var(--gold);
      font-size: .82rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: .09em;
      text-decoration: none;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      transition: transform .2s, box-shadow .2s;
    }
    .button:hover, .button:focus-visible {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(243,205,123,.25);
    }

    .orbit {
      position: absolute;
      z-index: -1;
      width: min(72vw, 650px);
      aspect-ratio: 1;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 50%;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 90px rgba(169,140,255,.06);
      animation: breathe 7s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    .orbit::before, .orbit::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 13%;
      border: 1px solid rgba(169,140,255,.2);
      border-radius: 50%;
    }
    .orbit::after { inset: 32%; border-color: rgba(243,205,123,.3); }

    section { position: relative; padding: 110px 0; }
    .section-head {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: .8fr 1.2fr;
      gap: 60px;
      align-items: end;
      margin-bottom: 64px;
    }
    h2 { font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 5.4rem); letter-spacing: -.045em; line-height: .95; }
    .section-head p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.08rem; }

    .principles {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 4px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .principle {
      min-height: 250px;
      padding: 28px 22px;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.025);
    }
    .principle:last-child { border: 0; }
    .number { color: var(--violet); font: italic 1rem Georgia, serif; }
    h3 { margin: 78px 0 8px; font: 1.35rem Georgia, serif; }
    .principle p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; line-height: 1.5; }

    .gathering {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 4px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(169,140,255,.1), rgba(255,255,255,.02));
    }
    .gathering > div { padding: clamp(32px, 6vw, 72px); }
    .portal {
      display: grid;
      min-height: 420px;
      place-items: center;
      border-left: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(243,205,123,.14), transparent 47%);
    }
    .portal-symbol {
      display: grid;
      width: 190px;
      aspect-ratio: 1;
      place-items: center;
      border: 1px solid var(--gold);
      border-radius: 50%;
      color: var(--gold);
      font: italic 5rem Georgia, serif;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 24px rgba(243,205,123,.035), 0 0 60px rgba(243,205,123,.12);
    }
    .details { margin: 30px 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
    .details li { padding: 12px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--muted); }
    .details strong { display: inline-block; min-width: 92px; color: var(--ink); }

    blockquote {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: auto;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5vw, 5rem);
      line-height: 1.08;
      text-align: center;
    }
    blockquote span { color: var(--violet); }

    footer {
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 30px;
      padding: 38px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .82rem;
    }

    @keyframes breathe { 50% { transform: scale(1.03); opacity: .72; } }

    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      nav { display: none; }
      .hero { min-height: 620px; padding-block: 90px; }
      .section-head, .gathering { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .principles { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .principle { min-height: auto; border: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
      h3 { margin-top: 28px; }
      .portal { min-height: 300px; border: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
      footer { flex-direction: column; }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
      .orbit { animation: none; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <header>
      <a class="mark" href="#top" aria-label="Church of the Fifth Dimension, home">
        <span class="sigil" aria-hidden="true">V</span>
        Fifth Dimension
      </a>
      <nav aria-label="Primary navigation">
        <a href="#beliefs">Beliefs</a>
        <a href="#gather">Gather</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
      </nav>
    </header>
  </div>

  <main id="top">
    <div class="hero wrap">
      <div class="orbit" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">A sanctuary beyond the ordinary</div>
        <h1>Look past the <em>visible.</em></h1>
        <p class="intro">The Church of the Fifth Dimension is an independent community for curious minds, open hearts, and useful acts of wonder.</p>
        <a class="button" href="#gather">Enter the circle</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section id="beliefs" class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Five ways<br>to be here.</h2>
        <p>No impossible creed. No secret handshake. Just five practices for living with greater attention in this dimension—and kindness toward everyone sharing it.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="principles">
        <article class="principle"><span class="number">I</span><h3>Wonder</h3><p>Meet the unexplained with curiosity before certainty.</p></article>
        <article class="principle"><span class="number">II</span><h3>Presence</h3><p>Give this moment your undivided attention.</p></article>
        <article class="principle"><span class="number">III</span><h3>Kindness</h3><p>Leave every world a little gentler than you found it.</p></article>
        <article class="principle"><span class="number">IV</span><h3>Imagination</h3><p>Practice seeing what reality might yet become.</p></article>
        <article class="principle"><span class="number">V</span><h3>Service</h3><p>Turn good intentions into useful, earthly action.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="gather" class="wrap">
      <div class="gathering">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">The next crossing</div>
          <h2>Gather at<br>the threshold.</h2>
          <p class="intro">An hour of stillness, strange questions, shared stories, and plans to do some good nearby.</p>
          <ul class="details">
            <li><strong>When</strong> The fifth Sunday, at dusk</li>
            <li><strong>Where</strong> Online &amp; under open skies</li>
            <li><strong>Bring</strong> A question worth sharing</li>
          </ul>
          <a class="button" href="mailto:hello@fifthdimension.church">Request an invitation</a>
        </div>
        <div class="portal" aria-hidden="true"><div class="portal-symbol">5</div></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="about" class="wrap">
      <blockquote>“Perhaps another dimension is simply <span>another way of paying attention.</span>”</blockquote>
    </section>
  </main>

  <div class="wrap">
    <footer>
      <span>© 2025 Church of the Fifth Dimension</span>
      <span>Independent · Inclusive · Inquisitive</span>
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
